{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2mh3r6kg","type":"work","title":"二樓紀略","authors":[{"name":"佟賦偉","role":"撰","dynasty":"清","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bf2i"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《二樓紀略》•四卷","author_info":"國朝佟賦偉撰","summary":"國朝佟賦偉撰。賦偉字青士，襄平人。官甯國府知府。甯國舊有北樓，即南齊謝朓之高齋。明嘉靖中知府朱大器又起文昌台，設書院其下。賦偉更為修治，題曰南樓。每乘暇遊宴其間，因雜錄見聞為此書。多自述其政績及旁涉他事，不盡有關於二樓。既非地志，又非說部，九流之內，無類可歸，姑附之雜家類焉。","edition":"浙江巡撫采進本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《二樓紀略》四卷","author_info":"清佟賦偉撰","summary":"《二樓紀略》四卷。清佟賦偉撰。影印國家圖書館藏清康熙刻本。","edition":"影印國家圖書館藏清康熙刻本","volume":"第1176冊","section":"子部 雑家類"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《二樓紀畧》四卷","author_info":"清佟賦偉撰","summary":"《二樓紀畧》四卷。清佟賦偉撰。北京圖書館藏清康煕刻本。","edition":"北京圖書館藏清康煕刻本","volume":"第115冊","section":"子部"}],"juan_count":{"number":4},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-kangxiwushijiuben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/HY4090","metadata":{"edition":"康熙五十九年(1720)本","version":"v9","total_page":974,"paragraph_count":3906,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-kangxikeben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02096966","metadata":{"edition":"康熙刻本","version":"v3","total_page":323,"paragraph_count":2567,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02096966.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC1176%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":1176},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%93%E7%B4%80%E7%95%A5%28%E4%B8%80%29.djvu"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":4}],"measure_info":"四卷","additional_titles":["二樓紀畧"],"description":{"text":"佟賦偉（清）撰。四卷。見著錄於《欽定四庫全書總目》《續修四庫全書》